   "text": "Monday. Today's Kadamba menu: Tomato Pappu. Also Dal Pappu, Palak Pappu, Pappu Rice, and for dessert, a sweet Pappu. One bowl of Tomato Pappu has sat on that counter since 2009. Everyone is scared of the Pappu. The Pappu is scared of nobody. Also new this week: Prompt Bhai, registered for all fourteen Infinium events. ChatGPT filled in the form. The quiz and the hackathon start at the same time. He's in both."
